{"id": "1971215", "name": "מציאת כל הגבולות החלקיים של סדרה 3", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f", "params": ["t"], "body": "(-1)^t*(1+(-1)^(t/2)*1/floor(t^2/x))^(floor(n^2/x))"}, {"name": "g", "params": ["t"], "body": "(-1)^t*(1+(-1)^((t-1)/2)*1/floor(t^2/x))^(floor(n^2/x))"}], "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">גבולות חלקיים</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">פירוק לפי מחלקות שקילות של האינדקס</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div>נתונה הסדרה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;font-size:16px;line-height:2;overflow-x:auto;margin:10px 0;\">\n\\(\\displaystyle a_n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left(-1\\right)^n\\left(1+\\dfrac{\\left(-1\\right)^{n/2}}{\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{{{CT:0}}n^2}{{{CT:1}}}\\right\\rfloor}\\right)^{\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{{{CT:0}}n^2}{{{CT:1}}}\\right\\rfloor},&n=2k\\\\\n\\left(-1\\right)^n\\left(1+\\dfrac{\\left(-1\\right)^{\\frac{\\left(n-1\\right)}{2}}}{\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{{{CT:0}}n^2}{{{CT:1}}}\\right\\rfloor}\\right)^{\\left\\lfloor\\dfrac{{{CT:0}}n^2}{{{CT:1}}}\\right\\rfloor},&n=2k+1\n\\end{cases}\\)\n</div>\n<div>מצאו את <b>כל הגבולות החלקיים</b> שלה.</div></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border:1px solid #EEECEF;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\" dir=\"ltr\">[[input:ans1]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border:1px solid #EEECEF;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:4px;\">אופן הזנת התשובה</div>\n<div>יש להזין את כל הגבולות החלקיים כרשימה, למשל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle [L_1,L_2]\\)</span>. אם יש גבול יחיד יש להזין <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle [L_1]\\)</span>.</div></div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">פתרון</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">פירוק לפי \\(\\displaystyle n\\) מודולו \\(\\displaystyle 4\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><p>נסמן \\(\\displaystyle M_n=\\left\\lfloor \\frac{n^2}{x}\\right\\rfloor\\), כאשר \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:2}}\\). אז \\(\\displaystyle M_n\\to\\infty\\), ולכן</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\left(1+\\frac1{M_n}\\right)^{M_n}\\to e,\\;\\;\n\\left(1-\\frac1{M_n}\\right)^{M_n}\\to e^{-1}\\)</p>\n<p>הסימנים בנוסחה תלויים במחלקה של \\(\\displaystyle n\\) מודולו \\(\\displaystyle 4\\). מתקבלים ארבעה גבולות:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\\(\\displaystyle n\\equiv0\\pmod4\\): הגבול הוא \\(\\displaystyle e\\).</li>\n<li>\\(\\displaystyle n\\equiv2\\pmod4\\): הגבול הוא \\(\\displaystyle e^{-1}\\).</li>\n<li>\\(\\displaystyle n\\equiv1\\pmod4\\): הגבול הוא \\(\\displaystyle -e\\).</li>\n<li>\\(\\displaystyle n\\equiv3\\pmod4\\): הגבול הוא \\(\\displaystyle -e^{-1}\\).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>לכן רשימת כל הגבולות החלקיים היא</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle [-e,-e^{-1},e^{-1},e]\\)</p></div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "limit", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "user_ans: sort(listify(setify(ans1)));\nleng:length(user_ans);\nss:0;\nfor j:1 while j<=leng do ss:ss+product(abs(user_ans[j]-ta[i]),i,1,2);\nfor i:1 while i<=2 do ss:ss+product(abs(user_ans[j]-ta[i]),j,1,leng);\ncor:is(ss>=0) and (ss<=0);\nis_list: listp(ans1);\nss1:product(abs(user_ans[j]-%e),j,1,leng);\nss2:product(abs(user_ans[j]+1/%e),j,1,leng);\nss3:product(abs(user_ans[j]+%e),j,1,leng);\nss4:product(abs(user_ans[j]-1/%e),j,1,leng);\nis_partial_a:is(ss1>=0) and (ss1<=0);\nis_partial_b:is(ss2>=0) and (ss2<=0);\nis_partial_c:is(ss3>=0) and (ss3<=0);\nis_partial_d:is(ss4>=0) and (ss4<=0);\nis_patial_more: is_partial_a and is_partial_b and is_partial_c and is_partial_d; /* and wrong ans*/\nis_patial_less: is_partial_a or is_partial_b or is_partial_c or is_partial_d; /* and not(is_patial_more) */\n\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Sets", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correct_answer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">מצאת את כל ארבעת הגבולות החלקיים.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "is_list", "tans": "false", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<p>תשובה לא בפורמט שנתבקשתם! שגוי<br></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "is_patial_more", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.75, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">כל ארבעת הגבולות הנכונים מופיעים, אך נוספו גם ערכים שאינם גבולות חלקיים.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "is_partial_a", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">זיהית את \\(\\displaystyle e\\) כגבול חלקי.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": "<p>תשובה שגויה.</p>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "is_partial_b", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "Result-5-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">זיהית את \\(\\displaystyle -e^{-1}\\) כגבול חלקי.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "Result-5-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "is_partial_c", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "Result-6-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">זיהית את \\(\\displaystyle -e\\) כגבול חלקי.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "Result-6-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 6, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "is_partial_d", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-7-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">זיהית את \\(\\displaystyle e^{-1}\\) כגבול חלקי.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-7-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "correct_answer", "ta", "x"], "nvariants": 50}